{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dynamic-style cursor made by myself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Since it involves modifying system files and has a relatively large size, you\u2019ll need to install it manually!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scripted Installation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steam, click the gear icon in the upper right \u2192 Manage \u2192 Browse Local Files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the path and find the \u201cDLC\u201d folder (...\\feeding yuyuko\\DLC\\Cursor-***)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the cursor folder, right-click Install.inf and select <i>Install</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to Windows Settings \u2192 Personalization \u2192 Mouse Pointers, and select the pointer scheme you just imported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If the scripted installation fails, please install manually:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click Install.inf, choose <i>Open with \u2192 Notepad</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Windows Settings \u2192 Personalization \u2192 Mouse Pointers, create a new cursor scheme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace each pointer one by one according to the file names</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If the cursor appears too small:</strong><br>Open Windows Settings \u2192 Ease of Access \u2192 Mouse Pointer, and adjust the pointer size.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046140?t=1759253436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046140?t=1759253436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046140/a770c43e71ad9210fe9ab189e92f96825c883953/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759253436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046140/a770c43e71ad9210fe9ab189e92f96825c883953/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759253436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dynamic-style cursor made by myself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Since it involves modifying system files and has a relatively large size, you\u2019ll need to install it manually!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scripted Installation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steam, click the gear icon in the upper right \u2192 Manage \u2192 Browse Local Files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the path and find the \u201cDLC\u201d folder (...\\feeding yuyuko\\DLC\\Cursor-***)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the cursor folder, right-click Install.inf and select <i>Install</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to Windows Settings \u2192 Personalization \u2192 Mouse Pointers, and select the pointer scheme you just imported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If the scripted installation fails, please install manually:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click Install.inf, choose <i>Open with \u2192 Notepad</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Windows Settings \u2192 Personalization \u2192 Mouse Pointers, create a new cursor scheme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace each pointer one by one according to the file names</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If the cursor appears too small:</strong><br>Open Windows Settings \u2192 Ease of Access \u2192 Mouse Pointer, and adjust the pointer size.</p>","developers":["LancerKoi"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4045150","